\p{Not built in this pass (and why): X1's \code{\verb~|once~} filter for EVAL tabling (measured only against sets without \code{\verb~|bodies~} and the K1 blocks; a change of \code{\verb~|Eval~} after the gates would have needed all of them again); an exact treatment of eager reduction (the declined declarations are 0.2-0.9 \% of the units and about a tenth of the workers' time on mathlib and Std: the first item of "what is left").}
}
}
